'''Hitting Hammer''' (Japanese: '''ヒットハンマー''' ''Hit Hammer'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Flip 2 coins. If both of them are heads, discard a random Energy from your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Crushing Hammer}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but requires two successful coin flips instead of one, can only discard Energy from the opponent's Active Pokémon, and the discarded Energy is chosen randomly.
